        <mxCell id="paths_legacy" value="Farm: encrypted store-and-forward to public IoT Core. Center: firewall -&gt; IPsec hub -&gt; pdn allow-listed private endpoints. Drone: pre-signed S3 upload from center or municipal seat. Transport + port: public application API.&#10;2020 retained: farm telemetry, alerts and sack traceability. Retired: assumed farm coverage, direct device-to-ingestion publishing and mobile-generation dependence; vessel tracking is out of scope." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef5fb;strokeColor=#61788d;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=21;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
